        <briefdescription>
<para>Construct a <ref refid="classSplineInterpolator" kindref="compound">SplineInterpolator</ref> on the given interpolation index range. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The extrapolation rules are initialised from the discrete space of <computeroutput>Basis</computeroutput>, so the corresponding ddc discrete space must be initialised before construction. This overload is only available when both extrapolation rules can be built automatically (they are default-constructible, or the tag <ref refid="structExtrapolationRule_1_1Constant" kindref="compound">ExtrapolationRule::Constant</ref> is used) - otherwise use the overload that takes the extrapolation rules explicitly.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>label</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>A label used to tag parallel regions and memory allocations for profiling. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>idx_range</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The 1D interpolation index range passed to the builder. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
